type: software
title: 'Evidence-Limited Assurance for AI-Agent Execution: Three Reproducible Counterexamples'
authors:
  - family-names: Naidenko
    given-names: Vladislav
repository-code: 'https://github.com/vladislavnaidenkopro-code/agent-execution-assurance'
url: 'https://github.com/vladislavnaidenkopro-code/agent-execution-assurance'
abstract: >-
  Public, synthetic and bounded epistemic demonstrations of evidence
  sufficiency for execution-time authorization, at-most-once effects,
  and rollback detection. These models are not deployed security mechanisms
  and the work has not undergone independent peer review.
keywords:
  - AI agent security
  - execution assurance
  - evidence sufficiency
  - audit logs
  - idempotency
